<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en" class="inter_c15e96cb-module__0bjUvq__variable instrument_serif_ef0c012d-module__w-V2xW__variable barlow_condensed_fce569ac-module__9QzpbW__variable"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/chunks/b7a0d4832ed7cfa6.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/2116fba765aea86e.js"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/82abf2d65f5428ae.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/9c8b4b13c35e0731.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/8f02d17ed0289fd9.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-1901b0f4e0b995c5.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/744355e03808d4c7.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/721328229b89ad5c.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/2f60ed77e425ec60.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/58643ccde0a6b89b.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/5ada20b92856e2a1.js" async=""></script><link rel="preload" href="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-H1JZ65H8SL" as="script"/><meta name="next-size-adjust" content=""/><title>About | The Learning Standard</title><meta name="description" content="The Learning Standard catalogues educational apps, publishes privacy-policy findings and develops learning science evaluations."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://thelearningstandard.org/about"/><meta property="og:title" content="About | The Learning Standard"/><meta property="og:description" content="The Learning Standard catalogues educational apps, publishes privacy-policy findings and develops learning science evaluations."/><meta property="og:site_name" content="The Learning Standard"/><meta property="og:locale" content="en_US"/><meta property="og:image:alt" content="The Learning Standard: Do Educational Apps Actually Teach?"/><meta property="og:image:type" content="image/png"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://thelearningstandard.org/opengraph-image?b9cfe88f5c347e08"/><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"/><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="About | The Learning Standard"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="The Learning Standard catalogues educational apps, publishes privacy-policy findings and develops learning science evaluations."/><meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="The Learning Standard: Do Educational Apps Actually Teach?"/><meta name="twitter:image:type" content="image/png"/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://thelearningstandard.org/twitter-image?2acdda5d527c62b3"/><meta name="twitter:image:width" content="1200"/><meta name="twitter:image:height" content="630"/><link rel="icon" href="/icon?7b1b022f96cae607" type="image/png" sizes="32x32"/><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-icon?7fae57fb939a7694" type="image/png" sizes="180x180"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/a6dad97d9634a72d.js" noModule=""></script></head><body class="font-sans"><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class="sticky top-0 z-50 transition-all duration-200 bg-transparent"><nav class="container-institutional"><div class="flex h-16 items-center justify-between"><a class="flex items-center gap-3 group" href="/"><div class="font-display text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-pass border-2 border-pass px-2 py-1 transform -rotate-2 group-hover:rotate-0 transition-transform">TLS</div><span class="font-serif text-lg text-ink hidden sm:block">The Learning Standard</span></a><div class="hidden items-center gap-8 md:flex"><a class="font-display text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-muted transition-colors hover:text-ink" href="/apps">Directory</a><a class="font-display text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-muted transition-colors hover:text-ink" href="/news">News</a><a class="font-display text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-muted transition-colors hover:text-ink" href="/methodology">Methodology</a><a class="font-display text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-muted transition-colors hover:text-ink" href="/about">About</a></div><button class="p-2 text-ink md:hidden" aria-label="Open menu"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-menu" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16"></path><path d="M4 12h16"></path><path d="M4 19h16"></path></svg></button></div></nav></header><main class="min-h-screen"><section class="border-b border-ink/10 bg-paper"><div class="container-institutional py-16 lg:py-24"><div class="max-w-3xl"><div class="inline-block font-display text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-muted mb-6 border-b-2 border-ink/20 pb-2">About Us</div><h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-ink leading-[1.1] mb-6">The IIHS for Educational Apps</h1><p class="text-lg text-ink-muted max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">Just as the Insurance Institute for Highway Safety transformed car safety with clear, binary crash test ratings, The Learning Standard brings the same clarity to educational technology.</p></div></div></section><section class="py-16 lg:py-24"><div class="container-institutional"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12"><div><h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-ink mb-6">Our Mission</h2><p class="text-ink-muted mb-4">The educational app market is flooded with products that claim to teach but don&#x27;t. Parents spend money and children spend time on apps that are designed to be engaging, not educational.</p><p class="text-ink-muted mb-4">We help families understand educational apps through published privacy-policy findings and a transparent learning science methodology. A directory listing is not a completed Learning Standard evaluation.</p><p class="text-ink-muted">No app pays for placement or ratings. Published findings are separate from evaluations that have not yet been completed.</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-muted">No active apps have published Learning Standard evaluations with invariant results yet.<!-- --> <!-- -->As of <!-- -->2026-10-30<!-- --> (UTC).</p></div><div class="bg-paper-dark border border-ink/10 p-8"><h3 class="font-display text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-muted mb-6">By the Numbers</h3><dl class="space-y-6"><div><dt class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-ink">1,036</dt><dd class="text-ink-muted mt-1">Apps in our registry</dd></div><div><dt class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-ink">333</dt><dd class="text-ink-muted mt-1">Apps with third-party certifications</dd></div><div><dt class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-ink">764</dt><dd class="text-ink-muted mt-1">Apps with listed grade levels</dd></div></dl><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-ink-muted">As of <!-- -->2026-10-30<!-- --> (UTC).</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-paper-dark border-y border-ink/10"><div class="container-institutional"><h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-ink mb-12">Why Trust Our Ratings</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8"><div><h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-ink mb-3">No Pay-for-Play</h3><p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">App developers cannot pay for ratings, placement, or reviews. Our evaluations are completely independent.</p></div><div><h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-ink mb-3">Science-Based</h3><p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">We use the Invariant framework, developed by learning science researchers, not subjective opinions or popularity metrics.</p></div><div><h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-ink mb-3">Transparent Methodology</h3><p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Our evaluation criteria are public. Anyone can understand exactly why an app passed or failed.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-16 lg:py-24"><div class="container-institutional"><div class="max-w-3xl"><h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-ink mb-6">For Developers &amp; AI Agents</h2><p class="text-ink-muted mb-6">Our data is available via API for developers building educational recommendation systems, and via structured formats for AI agents helping families find learning apps.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4"><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/api/apps">API Documentation<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/llms.txt">llms.txt</a></div></div></div></section><section class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-ink text-paper"><div class="container-institutional text-center"><h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl mb-4">Find apps that actually teach</h2><p class="text-paper/70 mb-8 max-w-md mx-auto">Browse our registry and make informed decisions about your family&#x27;s educational technology.</p><a class="btn bg-paper text-ink hover:bg-paper/90" href="/apps">Browse Directory<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></section></main><footer class="border-t border-ink/10 bg-ink text-paper/70"><div class="container-institutional py-12"><div class="flex flex-col gap-8 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between"><div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="font-display text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-pass border-2 border-pass px-2 py-1 transform -rotate-2">TLS</div><span class="font-serif text-lg text-paper">The Learning Standard</span></div><p class="mt-4 max-w-xs text-sm text-paper/50">Authoritative ratings of educational apps based on learning science.</p></div><div class="flex gap-12"><div><h4 class="font-display text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-paper/40 mb-3">Navigate</h4><ul class="space-y-2 text-sm"><li><a class="hover:text-paper transition-colors" href="/apps">Directory</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-paper transition-colors" href="/methodology">Methodology</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-paper transition-colors" href="/guides/choosing-reading-apps">Choosing Reading Apps</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-paper transition-colors" href="/about">About</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-paper transition-colors" href="/news">News</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-paper transition-colors" href="/corrections">Corrections and disputes</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-paper transition-colors" href="/contact">Contact</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-paper transition-colors" href="/terms">Terms</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-paper transition-colors" href="/privacy">Privacy</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class="font-display text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-paper/40 mb-3">Developers</h4><ul class="space-y-2 text-sm"><li><a class="hover:text-paper transition-colors" href="/connect">Connect</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-paper transition-colors" href="/api/apps">API</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-paper transition-colors" href="/llms.txt">llms.txt</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-paper/10 text-xs text-paper/40">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> The Learning Standard. All rights reserved.</div></div></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><script src="/_next/static/chunks/2116fba765aea86e.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).pus